{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "The host jobs that report through node_exporter's textfile collector rather than a scrape target of their own: every textfile check homelab-check-lib.sh writes (homelab_check_*), the homelab-updater on each host (homelab_host_*) and the builder's signed repository (homelab_repo_published_info). The alert rules in files/rules/host-checks.yaml read the same series; this board shows them all at once. Every query keys on the scrape's `origin` label, not the producer's `host`, to match the rules.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Textfile checks whose last verdict was down (homelab_check_success == 0). Each one has its own `*Failed` rule in files/rules/.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(homelab_check_success{job=~\"node|node-pi\"} == 0) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Checks red",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Textfile checks whose last write is older than the homelab_check_deadline_seconds the check declares, the comparison HostCheckOverdue makes. A check whose file is gone is not counted: only its own NotReporting rule can see that.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count((time() - homelab_check_last_run_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"node|node-pi\"}) > on (job, instance, origin, check) homelab_check_deadline_seconds{job=~\"node|node-pi\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Checks past their deadline",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Hosts whose homelab-updater wrote homelab_host_reconcile_ok 0 on its last run. HostReconcileFailed pages one after 15 minutes; docs/host-packages.md is the runbook.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(homelab_host_reconcile_ok{job=~\"node|node-pi\"} == 0) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Hosts not reconciled",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "One row per check file a host job writes through homelab-check-lib.sh into node_exporter's textfile directory. Age is seconds since the check's last verdict; Age / deadline above 100% means the producer missed its own deadline. Each query is aggregated to (origin, check) so the merge transform joins the three series into one row. A check whose .prom file is gone has no row at all.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Verdict"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0,
                        "text": "down"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1,
                        "text": "up"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Age"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Deadline"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Age / deadline"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 0.8
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "desc": true,
            "displayName": "Age / deadline"
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin, check) (homelab_check_success{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin, check) (time() - homelab_check_last_run_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin, check) (homelab_check_deadline_seconds{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin, check) ((time() - homelab_check_last_run_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"node|node-pi\"}) / homelab_check_deadline_seconds{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Textfile checks",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "Value #A": 2,
              "Value #B": 3,
              "Value #C": 4,
              "Value #D": 5,
              "check": 1,
              "origin": 0
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "Verdict",
              "Value #B": "Age",
              "Value #C": "Deadline",
              "Value #D": "Age / deadline",
              "check": "Check",
              "origin": "Host"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "homelab-updater's state per host, from homelab_host.prom and homelab_host_reconcile.prom. Reconciled is homelab_host_reconcile_ok; Last success is the age of homelab_host_update_success_timestamp_seconds; Verify mismatches counts `dpkg --verify` lines for the two packages; Drift sums homelab_host_reconcile_drift over its arms; Restarts owed counts homelab_host_activation_pending units. A blank Last success means the host has never recorded a successful update.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Reconciled"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0,
                        "text": "no"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 1,
                        "text": "yes"
                      }
                    },
                    "type": "value"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Last success"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Verify mismatches"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Drift"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Restarts owed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin) (homelab_host_reconcile_ok{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin) (time() - homelab_host_update_success_timestamp_seconds{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin) (homelab_host_verify_mismatches{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (origin) (homelab_host_reconcile_drift{job=~\"node|node-pi\"}) or 0 * max by (origin) (homelab_host_reconcile_ok{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count by (origin) (homelab_host_activation_pending{job=~\"node|node-pi\"}) or 0 * max by (origin) (homelab_host_reconcile_ok{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "E"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Host updater",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "Value #A": 1,
              "Value #B": 2,
              "Value #C": 3,
              "Value #D": 4,
              "Value #E": 5,
              "origin": 0
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "Reconciled",
              "Value #B": "Last success",
              "Value #C": "Verify mismatches",
              "Value #D": "Drift",
              "Value #E": "Restarts owed",
              "origin": "Host"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The homelab-host package version each host's updater last applied successfully (homelab_host_applied_info, the record's last_ok). Compare its sha with the builder's published sha beside it: a host behind the builder for longer than one updater cycle is held or failing. A host that has never applied anything has no row.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin, version, sha) (homelab_host_applied_info{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Applied by each host",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "origin": 0,
              "sha": 2,
              "version": 1
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "origin": "Host",
              "sha": "Commit",
              "version": "Version"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The newest version of each package the builder's signed repository serves (homelab_repo_published_info, written by homelab-repo-sign). `probe.py builder` reads the same series.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin, package, version, sha) (homelab_repo_published_info)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Published by the builder",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "origin": 3,
              "package": 0,
              "sha": 2,
              "version": 1
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "origin": "Builder",
              "package": "Package",
              "sha": "Commit",
              "version": "Version"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "homelab_host_reconcile_ok per host across the selected range, so a hold that cleared before you looked still shows.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "not reconciled"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "reconciled"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.9,
        "showValue": "never",
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (origin) (homelab_host_reconcile_ok{job=~\"node|node-pi\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{origin}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Reconciled over time",
      "type": "state-timeline"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "hosts",
    "textfile"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Host jobs",
  "uid": "homelab-host-jobs",
  "version": 1
}
